		<item>
		<title>Independent promotion founded by WWE champion set for January 2027 return</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397845-independent-promotion-founded-by-wwe-champion-set-for-january-2027-return/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397845-independent-promotion-founded-by-wwe-champion-set-for-january-2027-return/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:14:54 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Misc. News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Alpha 1]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ethan Page]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397845</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Alpha-1 Wrestling has revealed new details on their return in 2027, the first since their &#8216;Final Act&#8217; event&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397845-independent-promotion-founded-by-wwe-champion-set-for-january-2027-return/">Independent promotion founded by WWE champion set for January 2027 return</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Alpha-1 Wrestling has revealed <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/Df3kJSghc_H/">new details</a> on their return in 2027, the first since their &#8216;Final Act&#8217; event on November 1.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The independent promotion, founded by current WWE Intercontinental Champion Ethan Page, will present OUR F.A.N.S. (Futures Are Not Safe) on January 17, with such names as Tyler Breeze, Jody Threat, Warhorse, and more when Alpha-1 heads to Hamilton, Ontario, Canada.</p>



