		<item>
		<title>Despite appearance by John Cena, WWE SmackDown overall viewership down</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397832-despite-appearance-by-john-cena-wwe-smackdown-overall-viewership-down/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397832-despite-appearance-by-john-cena-wwe-smackdown-overall-viewership-down/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:54:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ratings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Smackdown]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[USA Network]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397832</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Last Friday&#8217;s WWE SmackDown on the USA Network, featuring an appearance by John Cena, came in with 1.169&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397832-despite-appearance-by-john-cena-wwe-smackdown-overall-viewership-down/">Despite appearance by John Cena, WWE SmackDown overall viewership down</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Last Friday&#8217;s WWE SmackDown on the USA Network, featuring an appearance by John Cena, came in with 1.169 million viewers. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This number is down from the previous week&#8217;s show, which had 1.195 million households tune in. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the key 18-49 demographic, SmackDown had a 0.27 rating, which is up from the 0.25 rating from the week before.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/wwe-smackdown-nov-13-on-usa-network-1169000-viewers-0-27-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="757" height="532" src="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-6.png" alt="" class="wp-image-397834" srcset="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-6.png 757w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-6-600x422.png 600w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-6-380x267.png 380w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-6-550x386.png 550w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px" /></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe loading="lazy" title="Top 10 SmackDown moments: WWE Top 10, Nov. 13, 2026" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/4OwRGrh9kHg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397832-despite-appearance-by-john-cena-wwe-smackdown-overall-viewership-down/">Despite appearance by John Cena, WWE SmackDown overall viewership down</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
