			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Update on Anthony Bowens&#8217; status with AEW</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397829-update-on-anthony-bowens-status-with-aew/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397829-update-on-anthony-bowens-status-with-aew/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:44:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Anthony Bowens]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[contract]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[update.]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397829</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Per a new report from Fightful Select, sources within AEW have informed have claimed that AEW plans to&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397829-update-on-anthony-bowens-status-with-aew/">Update on Anthony Bowens&#8217; status with AEW</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Per a new report from Fightful Select, sources within AEW have informed have claimed that AEW plans to re-sign Anthony Bowens after his contract expired last month. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The report also indicates that Bowens could have already re-signed with AEW and that if he hasn&#8217;t signed already, it could happen soon. It was added that Bowens&#8217; bio was never removed from AEW&#8217;s roster page.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Bowens tag team partner Max Caster&#8217;s deal expired the same time as Bowens&#8217; contract. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Prior to his deal expiring, Bowens was a part of The Opps faction, alongside Samoa Joe, Hook and Katsuyori Shibata.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397829-update-on-anthony-bowens-status-with-aew/">Update on Anthony Bowens&#8217; status with AEW</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397829-update-on-anthony-bowens-status-with-aew/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>TNA star announces pregnancy</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397824-tna-star-announces-pregnancy/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397824-tna-star-announces-pregnancy/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:31:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Ash By Elegance]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[pregnant]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397824</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>During her appearance on the most recent episode of TMZ&#8217;s Inside the Ring, TNA star Ash By Elegance&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397824-tna-star-announces-pregnancy/">TNA star announces pregnancy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During her appearance on the most recent episode of TMZ&#8217;s Inside the Ring, TNA star Ash By Elegance announced she and her husband, Ulysses Diaz are expecting a baby boy, as she is 32 weeks pregnant.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">She also revealed that back in August 2025, she was pregnant, but unfortunately miscarried, which was the reason she relinquished the TNA Knockouts Title and stepped away from in-ring competition at that time.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">She also said that as a result of the miscarriage, she was admitted to the ICU with severe stomach pain that caused internal bleeding and required her to undergo three blood transfusions. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The full interview is below.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe loading="lazy" title="Ash By Elegance Reveals Pregnancy After Miscarriage &amp; Crohn’s Disease Battle | Inside The Ring" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9kZdSu4fR0A?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397824-tna-star-announces-pregnancy/">TNA star announces pregnancy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
